      choices: ['Peacekeeper casualties', 'The risk of war resuming with versus without peacekeepers — finding deployment roughly halves the recurrence risk', 'UN budgets', 'Diplomatic statements'],
      answer: 1,
      why: 'Comparing post-war cases matched on the confounders, peacekeeping presence is associated with a substantially lower probability of renewed fighting — often by half or more. The mechanism is credible commitment: monitors make both sides\' promises enforceable.',
